  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 30 January 2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 17 October 2025 and numbered 320B-313-01A, 320B-300-01A and on 30 January 2026 and numbered 320B-320-01B, 320B-321-01B, 320B-321-02B, 320B-321-03B, 320B-322-01B, 320B-322-02C, 320B-312-03B, 320B-322-03B was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class A, Clause 3(a) and Class B, Clause(s) 1(d) and 2(a) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the materials used in the exterior work are not specified to be of similar appearance to those used for the existing dwellinghouse and the total roof volume is increasing the original roof by more than 50 cubic metres.\r\n"
